BSD-3-Clause licences (several are dual MIT or Apache-2.0, and the MIT terms
are used). Their notices are in LICENSE.dependencies, included in the RPM and
in the source tarball and generated from the vendored crates.

Source offer. Every release of elastic-swap carries the corresponding source:
the source RPM and the source and vendored-crates tarballs are attached to
https://github.com/luminusOS/elastic-swap/releases. A system image that
contains the binary can get the same source from that page, and from the
repository at the tag that matches the installed version.

Modifications. elastic-swap changes biglinux-systemd-swap (itself derived from
systemd-swap) from 2026-10-24 onward. The changes are recorded in the git
history of this repository, starting after commit 61cf629.

